      "content": "hey, i'm working on the new credit-scoring model for our fintech platform. we're trying to align it with our ESG (environmental, social, and governance) commitments. can you explain why optimizing our algorithm for 'equality of outcome' is the most ethically sound approach for our company's goals?",
